#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0058 expect=skipped domain=SV
#note "SV is out of FDA-SD0058 scope since 2026-10-02: SE, SV, DM and CO carry IG grants for additional variables and are checked by the split siblings FDA-SD0058-A..D. EPOCH here would otherwise be reported, although SV Assumption 11 permits it."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library model-column-order SV STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID VISITNUM VISIT VISITDY SVSTDTC SVENDTC SVSTDY SVENDY SVUPDES
dataset SV
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col VISITNUM type=Num
col VISIT type=Char
col SVSTDTC type=Char
col EPOCH type=Char
---
S1 | SV | 001 | 1 | WEEK 1 | 2012-07-09 | TREATMENT
---
